  "question": {
    "text": "The density of $3 \\mathrm{M}$ solution of sodium chloride is $1.252 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mL}^{-1}$. The molality of the solution will be :\n$\\left(\\right.$ molar mass, $\\left.\\mathrm{NaCl}=585 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right)$",
