  "solution": {
    "text": "The relation between molarity (M) and molality $(m)$ is\n$d=\\mathrm{M}\\left(\\frac{1}{m}+\\frac{\\mathrm{M}_2}{1000}\\right), \\mathrm{M}_2=$ Mol. mass of solute\nOn putting value\n$$\n1.252=3\\left(\\frac{1}{m}+\\frac{58.5}{1000}\\right)\n$$\non solving $m=2.79$",
